**theorem 65.1（引理：两个局部查询的精确纤维）。** 对任意 $c\in A$，模 $8$ 计算有
$$
\begin{aligned}
D_{2,3,c}^{-1}(3)&=\{c\},\\
D_{2,3,c}^{-1}(2)&=\{c+4\},\\
D_{2,3,c}^{-1}(1)&=\{c+2,c+6\},\\
D_{2,3,c}^{-1}(0)&=\{c+1,c+3,c+5,c+7\}.
\end{aligned}
$$
对任意 $d\in B$，模 $9$ 计算有
$$
\begin{aligned}
D_{3,2,d}^{-1}(2)&=\{d\},\\
D_{3,2,d}^{-1}(1)&=\{d+3,d+6\},\\
D_{3,2,d}^{-1}(0)&=\{d+1,d+2,d+4,d+5,d+7,d+8\}.
\end{aligned}
$$

